# A centred input forms two images at 3 L_pi / 8, with L_pi = 92.70 um from the two lowest modes of the body.
# Reference: equal outputs by symmetry; near the imaging length each carries almost half.
title 1x2 multimode interferometer 6 um wide at 0.8 of the imaging length
reference 2.8
grid dx=0.02 dz=0.25
window width=16 length=52.75
guide straight x=0 width=1.2 from=0 to=10
guide straight x=0 width=6 from=10 to=37.75
guide straight x=1.5 width=1.2 from=37.75 to=52.75
guide straight x=-1.5 width=1.2 from=37.75 to=52.75
launch mode x=0 width=1.2
monitor upper z=52.75 x=1.5 width=1.2
monitor lower z=52.75 x=-1.5 width=1.2
plane end z=52.75
expect power upper 0.184214736 2e-7
expect power lower 0.184214736 2e-7
expect total end 0.996871835 2e-7
expect centroid end 0.0000000 2e-6
expect radius end 5.5391273 2e-6
expect neff 2.545685461 2e-8
expect ratio upper lower 1.0 1e-4
